### Careers Module API Test Requests
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or similar tools
### Replace <your-jwt-token> with actual JWT token
### Replace <role-id> with actual role ID from create response

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/v1
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJhY2Nlc3NfdXVpZCI6IjRmNTYyNDljLTBlOTAtNGQwMi05YTllLThmMzAzNTI5MTUyZiIsImF1dGhvcml6ZWQiOnRydWUsImV4cCI6MTc3MDA0OTU5NiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjIzNzRmNTMxLTc2NmMtNDEyYS1iOTE0LTE5NTQ3MzY2MzU2MiJ9.5TrRLbqdf2RNNqEE7NGinnJMktC9GoShnfso7Jacs3Y
@roleId = <role-id>

### 1. Create Career Role (Admin - Creates as draft)
POST {{baseUrl}}/careers/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "Head of People Operations (HPO)",
  "company_overview": "Trovotech Ltd is a SEC - regulated digital asset and tokenization platform building secure, compliant, and accessible investment infrastructure for real-world assets. Our mission is to build compliant, intuitive, and scalable technology that enables the tokenization, management and trade of real-world assets, expanding access to capital and investment opportunities within emerging and global markets.",
  "sections": {
    "The Role": [
      "This is a strategic leadership role, not an administrative HR position.",
      "You'll design and own hiring, onboarding, performance management, policy custodian and culture frameworks that support a fast-growing, regulated fintech."
    ],
    "What You'll Own": [
      "End-to-end people operations and HR strategy",
      "Hiring and onboarding systems across technical, compliance, and growth roles",
      "Performance, accountability, and leadership development frameworks",
      "Culture, values, and employee experience"
    ],
    "What We're Looking For": [
      "7+ years HR / People Ops experience (startup, fintech, or regulated environment preferred)",
      "Proven experience building people systems from scratch",
      "High integrity, sound judgment, and strong leadership presence"
    ],
    "What Success Looks Like": [
      "6 months: Hiring and performance systems fully operational",
      "12 months: Strong retention, engagement, and leadership depth"
    ]
  },
  "application": {
    "location": "Nigeria preferred - Remote/Hybrid",
    "apply": "Send CV + Short Note to hiring@trovotech.io",
    "subject": "Head of People Operations - Trovotech"
  }
}

### 2. Get All Career Roles (Public - Only Published)
GET {{baseUrl}}/careers/roles

### 3. Get All Career Roles (Admin - Includes Drafts)
GET {{baseUrl}}/careers/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get Career Role by ID (Public - Only if Published)
GET {{baseUrl}}/careers/roles/{{roleId}}

### 5. Get Career Role by ID (Admin - Includes Drafts)
GET {{baseUrl}}/careers/roles/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Update Career Role
PUT {{baseUrl}}/careers/roles/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "Head of People Operations (HPO) - Updated",
  "company_overview": "Updated company overview text...",
  "sections": {
    "The Role": [
      "Updated role description"
    ],
    "What You'll Own": [
      "Updated responsibilities"
    ],
    "What We're Looking For": [
      "Updated requirements"
    ],
    "What Success Looks Like": [
      "Updated success metrics"
    ]
  },
  "application": {
    "location": "Nigeria preferred - Remote/Hybrid",
    "apply": "Send CV + Short Note to hiring@trovotech.io",
    "subject": "Head of People Operations - Trovotech"
  }
}

### 7. Publish Career Role (Draft -> Published)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/careers/roles/{{roleId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Enable Career Role (Disabled -> Published)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/careers/roles/{{roleId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "published"
}

### 9. Disable Career Role (Published -> Disabled)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/careers/roles/{{roleId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "disabled"
}

### 10. Delete Career Role
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/careers/roles/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Example: Backend Developer Role
POST {{baseUrl}}/careers/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "Back End Developer",
  "company_overview": "Trovotech Ltd is a SEC - regulated digital asset and tokenization platform building secure, compliant, and accessible investment infrastructure for real-world assets.",
  "sections": {
    "The Role": [
      "This is a hands on technical role, not a support or maintenance position.",
      "As Backend Developer, you will design, develop, and maintain Trovotech's core backend systems, ensuring they are secure, scalable, and performant to handle investor transactions and asset management operations."
    ],
    "What You'll Own": [
      "Design, implement, and maintain backend systems, APIs, and databases",
      "Ensure security, scalability, and reliability of backend services",
      "Collaborate with Frontend and Blockchain developers to integrate APIs and services",
      "Optimize system performance and implement monitoring, logging, and troubleshooting"
    ],
    "What We're Looking For": [
      "5+ years experience in backend development (Node.js, Python, Go, Java, or similar)",
      "Strong experience with relational and NoSQL databases",
      "Experience designing and implementing RESTful APIs and microservices architecture",
      "Familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure) and CI/CD pipelines"
    ],
    "What Success Looks Like": [
      "6 months: Reliable, secure, and maintainable backend systems fully operational",
      "12 months: Scalable backend architecture supporting high-volume transactions and new product launches"
    ]
  },
  "application": {
    "location": "Nigeria preferred - Remote/Hybrid",
    "apply": "Send CV + Short Note (Include Portfolio/GitHub) to hiring@trovotech.io",
    "subject": "Backend Developer - Trovotech"
  }
}

### Example: Product Manager Role
POST {{baseUrl}}/careers/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "Product Manager",
  "company_overview": "Trovotech Ltd is a SEC - regulated digital asset and tokenization platform building secure, compliant, and accessible investment infrastructure for real-world assets.",
  "sections": {
    "The Role": [
      "This is a core product leadership role.",
      "As Product Manager, you will own the product vision, roadmap, and execution for key components of the Trovotech platform.",
      "You will act as the bridge between business, compliance, engineering, and users, ensuring that product decisions are commercially sound, technically feasible, and regulatorily compliant."
    ],
    "What You'll Own": [
      "Product vision, roadmap, and prioritization aligned with company strategy",
      "Translation of business and regulatory requirements into clear product specifications",
      "Ownership of product discovery, user research, and requirements definition",
      "Backlog management, sprint planning, and delivery alignment with engineering teams"
    ],
    "What We're Looking For": [
      "5+ years experience as a Product Manager in fintech, financial services, or technology-driven platforms",
      "Strong understanding of agile product development and SDLC",
      "Experience working on regulated or compliance-sensitive products",
      "Ability to translate complex requirements into intuitive user experiences"
    ],
    "What Success Looks Like": [
      "6 months: Clear product roadmap in place; predictable delivery rhythm established; strong cross-functional alignment",
      "12 months: Measurable improvements in product adoption, user experience, and platform reliability supporting business growth"
    ]
  },
  "application": {
    "location": "Nigeria preferred - Remote/Hybrid",
    "apply": "Send CV + Short Note to hiring@trovotech.io",
    "subject": "Product Manager - Trovotech"
  }
}
